# FORMAT EXAMPLE ONLY — the REAL root-finalized list now lives in
# p22-required-names.txt (10 names, 2026-11-14). This file stays as
# documentation of the format rules only:
#
#   * one top-level Go test name per line (no leading ./)
#   * `#` starts a comment; blank lines are ignored
#   * duplicate lines collapse to the FIRST occurrence (distinct count)
#   * run_tests_p22.sh integration enforces: top-level `=== RUN <name>`
#     AND top-level `--- PASS: <name>`, SKIP/FAIL priority, exact-name
#     boundary match (prefix traps rejected), no required SKIP
#   * a missing or empty names file FAILS CLOSED — no P2.2 PG blessing.

